{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Optimization.MatrixFarkasInstance","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Optimization.MatrixFarkasInstance","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Optimization.LPStrongDuality","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.FinitelyGeneratedConeClosed"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.lp_strong_duality_uncond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.lp_strong_duality_uncond","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/MatrixFarkasInstance.lean#L69-L75","doc":"**Strong duality, unconditional.** The same statement as\n`lp_strong_duality`, with the Farkas hypothesis discharged by the\ninstance above rather than assumed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.matrixFarkas_of_coneClosed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.matrixFarkas_of_coneClosed","kind":"instance","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/MatrixFarkasInstance.lean#L47-L67","doc":"**Farkas' lemma for the standard-form LP, as an instance.**\n\nThe class field is `farkas_alternative` verbatim; the proof is\n`QOU.Mathlib.farkas_alternative_real`, with the structures\n`PrimalFeasible` / `DualFeasible` packed and unpacked around it.\n\nRegistered as an `instance`, so every `[MatrixFarkas A a c]` hypothesis\nin this namespace now resolves without an assumption. ","signatureChunk":0}]}